and a pulmonary function test\n-  Stable clinical condition (without recent respiratory system infections or any exacerbation of the disease)\n-  Patients must be willing to re evaluate at the end of the study\n-  Patients must be willing to give written consent for their participation in the study\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of COPD confirmed by clinical examination",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "COPD"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "COPD"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "clinical examination"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "clinical examination"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "and a pulmonary function test",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "pulmonary function test"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "pulmonary function test"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Stable clinical condition (without recent respiratory system infections",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "respiratory system"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "infections",\n                    "clinical condition"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "infections",\n                    "clinical condition"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "recent"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Recency": [\