tive sperm counts) in monogamous relationship (same partner). An acceptable, although less reliable, method involves the careful use of condoms and spermicidal foam or gel",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "on"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "on"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "one"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "sperm counts"\n                              ],\n                              "Polarity": [\n                                "negative"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "sperm counts"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "acceptable"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "-"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "vasectomy"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "vasectomy"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "partner"\n                              ],\n                              "Drug": [\n                                "spermicidal foam",\n                                "condoms"\n                              ],\n                              "Drug-Name": [\n                                "spermicidal foam",\n                                "condoms"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "monogamous relationshi