ormed consent, patients that are terminal and expected to die within the next 48 hours will be excluded from the study.",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "to"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "within the next 48 hours"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "hours"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "48"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "next"\n      ],\n      "Negation": [\n        "unable"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "cognitively impaired"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "cognitively impaired"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "expected to"\n      ],\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ],\n      "Death": [\n        "die"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "informed consent"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "informed consent"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
