gnosis\n-  Who are or have been treated by pharmacological or physiotherapy in the last 6 months\n-  Presenting allergies or alterations of the skin\n-  Not sign the informed consent document.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Federated boxers",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "Federated boxers"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "-"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "Federated boxers"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "with lumbar injury with medical diagnosis",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "with"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "lumbar"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "with"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Who are or have been treated by pharmacological",\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "-"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "pharmacological"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "-",\n                    "last 6 months"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "last"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "6"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n           