n-  2. Provision of informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- 1. The patients who enrolled in the XPL-IVUS study.",\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- 2. Provision of informed consent",\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "2"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
