otocol-required treatment period, and currently receiving blinded study drug\n-  Women of childbearing potential (WOCBP) must have a negative urine pregnancy test and must agree to use correctly a highly effective method(s) of contraception for the duration of treatment with study drug\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n\t      "raw_text": "- Completion of SLE Study (NCT03252587) through the protocol-required treatment period, and currently receiving blinded study drug",\n\t      "Eq-Comparison": [\n\t        "currently receiving"\n\t      ],\n\t      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n\t        "currently receiving"\n\t      ],\n\t      "Study": [\n\t        "study"\n\t      ]\n\t    }\n\t  }\n\t},\n\t    "right": {\n\t      "AND": {\n\t        "left": {\n\t          "raw_text": "- Women",\n\t          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n\t            "Women"\n\t          ]\n\t        },\n\t        "right": {\n\t          "AND": {\n\t            "left": {\n\t              "raw_text": "of childbearing potential (WOCBP) must have a negative urine pregnancy test",\n\t              "Condition": [\n\t                "childbearing potential",\n\t                "WOCBP"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Condition-Name": [\n\t                "childbearing potential",\n\t                "WOCBP"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Observation": [\n\t                "urine pregnancy test"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Polarity": [\n\t                "negative"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Observation-Name": [\n\t                "urine pregnancy test"\n\t              ]\n\t            },\n\t            "right": {\n\t              "raw_text": "and must agree to use correctly a highly effective method(s) of contraception for the duration of treatment with study drug",\n\t              "Study": [\n\t                "study"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Drug": [\n\t                "contraception"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Assertion": [\n\t    