ils.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Patients scheduled for emergency surgery\n2. Patients with a history of drug abuse and / or alcohol abuse 2 years prior to the screening period\n3. One or more of the laboratory findings fall out of the limitations for this study(platelet,hemoglobin,aspartate aminotransferase,etc.)\n4. Pregnant women or those in lactation period\n5. Allergic to drugs used in the study\n6. Patients with respiratory management difficulties (Modified Mallampati grade IV)\n7. Patients have participated in other clinical trial within the 3 months prior to randomization\n8. Any patient judged by the Principal Investigator (PI) or Sub-Investigator to be inappropriate for the subject for any other reason\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "1. Patients scheduled for emergency surgery",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "scheduled"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "scheduled"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "emergency"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. Patients with a history of drug abuse",\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "history"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "drug abuse"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "history"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "drug"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation-Name": [\n                                    "drug"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "and / or alcohol abuse 2 years prior to the screening period",\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "2 years"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "alcohol abuse"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "2"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                    "years"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Study": [\n                                    "screening"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "3. One or more of the laboratory findings fall out of the limitations for this study(platelet,",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "One or more"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "One"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "or more"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                "h"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "laboratory findings",\n                                "platelet"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "laboratory findings",\n                                "platelet"\n                              ],\n                              "Study": [\n                                "study"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "hemoglobin,",\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "g"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "hemoglobin"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                    "h"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation-Name": [\n                                    "hemoglobin"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "aspartate aminotransferase,",\n                                      "Eq-Value": [\n                                        "a"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                        "h"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "aspartate aminotransferase"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                        "h"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "aspartate aminotransferase"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "etc.)",\n                                          "Eq-Value": [\n                                            "e"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                            "h"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "OR": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "4. Pregnant women",\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "Pregnant"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                                "women"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                                "Pregnant"\n                                              ]\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "raw_text": "or those in lactation period",\n                                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                                "e"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "lactation"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                                "lactation"\n                                              ]\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "5. Allergic to drugs used in the study",\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "e"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "drug",\n                            "drugs"\n                          ],\n                          "Drug": [\n                            "drug",\n                            "drugs"\n                          ],\n                          "Study": [\n                            "study"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n     