lish (as determined by having the individual read a brief, eighth grade reading level paragraph),\n-  able to begin the intervention within six weeks of their infant\'s birth,\n-  be able to participate in an intervention over two weeks, requiring approximately a 12-hour time commitment: either in-person on two Saturdays for six hours each, or a self-paced content of videos and resource materials over two weeks,\n-  own or have access to a device with internet access and\n-  have a working e-mail address.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n\t      "AND": {\n\t        "left": {\n\t          "AND": {\n\t            "left": {\n\t              "AND": {\n\t                "left": {\n\t                  "AND": {\n\t                    "left": {\n\t                      "AND": {\n\t                    "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- age 15 to 21,",\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "15 to 21"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "15",\n                            "21"\n                          ],\n                          "Age": [\n                            "age"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "to"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- be able to read and understand English (as determined by having the individual read a brief, eighth grade reading level paragraph),",\n                      "Language": [\n                        "English"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- able to begin the intervention within six weeks of their infant\'s birth,",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "within six