evice\n-  Age ≥ 18 years\n-  Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data\n-  Signed and dated informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n\t      "AND": {\n\t        "left": {\n\t          "AND": {\n\t            "left": {\n\t              "raw_text": "- Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device",\n\t              "Eq-Operator": [\n\t                "-"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Procedure": [\n\t                "Narval CC mandibular advancement device"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Procedure-Name": [\n\t                "Narval CC mandibular advancement device"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Comparison": [\n\t                "Prescription"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n\t                "Prescription"\n\t              ]\n\t            },\n\t            "right": {\n\t              "raw_text": "- Age ≥ 18 years",\n\t              "Eq-Operator": [\n\t                "≥",\n\t                "-"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Comparison": [\n\t                "≥ 18 years"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Value": [\n\t                "18"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n\t                "years"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Age": [\n\t                "Age"\n\t              ]\n\t            }\n\t          }\n\t        },\n\t        "right": {\n\t          "AND": {\n\t            "left": {\n\t              "raw_text": "- Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data",\n\t              "Eq-Operator": [\n\t                "-"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Comparison": [\n\t                "on"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n\t                "on"\n\t              ],\n\t              "Study": [\n\t                "study"\n\t              ]\n\t            },\n\t            "right": {\n\t              "raw_