ils.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Diagnosis of CD for at least 3 months prior to baseline\n-  Confirmed diagnosis of moderate to severe CD as assessed by SF, AP score, and SES-CD\n-  Demonstrated intolerance, loss of response or inadequate response to conventional or to biologic therapy for CD\n-  If female, subject must meet the contraception recommendations\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of CD for at least 3 months prior to baseline",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "at least"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "3"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "at least 3 months"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "CD"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "CD"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Confirmed diagnosis of moderate to severe CD as assessed by SF,AP score,",\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "to"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "moderate",\n                    "severe"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "CD"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "CD"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "moderate to severe"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "and SES-CD",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "CD",\n                        "SES-CD"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "CD",\n                        "SES-CD"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "Demonstrated intolerance, loss of response",\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "to"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "intolerance"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "loss of response"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "loss of response"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "or inadequate response to conventional",\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "conventional",\n                                "inadequate"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "response"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "response"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or to biologic therapy for CD",\n                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                    "to"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "biologic"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "CD"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "CD"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "therapy"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "therapy"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- If female,subject must meet the contraception recommendations for:",\n                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                        "-"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Modifier": [\n                                        "female"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Drug": [\n                                        "contraception"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Drug-Name": [\n                                        "contraception"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "1. subjects of childbearing age who are sexually active outside of a monogamous relationship,",\n                                          "Eq-Value": [\n                                            "1"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                            "childbearing"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                                            "to"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation": [\n                                            "sexually active"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation-Name": [\n                                            "sexually active"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                            "on"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                            "on"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Modifier": [\n                                            "monogamous relationship"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "OR": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "2. subjects who have entered a long-term sexual partnership,",\n                                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                                "2"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                                "to"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Observation": [\n                                                "sexual"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                                "sexual"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Acuteness": [\n                                                "long-term"\n                                              ]\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "OR": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "raw_text": "3. subjects who have agreed to use an adequate method of contraception (eg,",\n                                                  "Drug": [\n                                                    "contraception"\n                                                  ],\n                                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                                    "to"\n                                                  ],\n                                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                                    "3"\n                                                  ],\n                                                  "Drug-Name": [\n                                                    "contraception"\n                                                  ],\n                                                  "Polarity": [\n                                                    "adequate"\n                                                  ],\n                                                  "Assertion": [\n                                                    "agreed"\n                                                  ]\n                                                },\n                                                "right": {\n                                                  "OR": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "double barrier method: diaphragm, cervical cap, sponge, condom and spermicide, cervical sponge, sponge with spermicide",\n                                                      "Modifier": [\n                                                        "double barrier method:diaphragm",\n                                                        "cervical cap",\n                                                        "sponge"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Drug": [\n                                                        "spermicide"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Drug-Name": [\n                                                        "spermicide"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    },\n                                                    "right": {\n                                                      "OR": {\n                                                        "left": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "and sponge with spermicide) and subjects who are willing to use this method",\n                                                      "Drug": [\n                                                        "sponge with spermicide",\n                                                        "spermicide"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Assertion": [\n                                                        "willing to"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Drug-Name": [\n                                                        "sponge with spermicide",\n                                                        "spermicide"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    },\n                                                    "right": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "or use another method of contraception as directed by the Investigator.",\n                                                      "Drug": [\n                                                        "contraception",\n                                                        "another method of contraception"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                                        "to"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Drug-Name": [\n                                                        "contraception",\n                                                        "another method of contraception"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    }\n                                                  }\n                                                }\n                                              }\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
